lative_time 或 start_time/end_time\n- 限定在某个会话内搜索（chat_id）\n- 支持分页：page_size + page_token\n\n【参数约束】\n- 所有参数均可选，但至少应提供一个过滤条件\n- relative_time 和 start_time/end_time 不能同时使用\n- page_size 范围 1-50，默认 50\n\n返回消息列表，每条消息包含 message_id、msg_type、content、sender、create_time 等字段。\n每条消息还包含 chat_id、chat_type（p2p/group）、chat_name（群名或单聊对方名字）。\n单聊消息额外包含 chat_partner（对方 open_id 和名字）。\n搜索结果中的 chat_id 和 thread_id 可配合 feishu_im_user_get_messages / feishu_im_user_get_thread_messages 查看上下文。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"description":"搜索关键词，匹配消息内容。可为空字符串表示不按内容过滤","type":"string"},"sender_ids":{"description":"发送者 open_id 列表。如需根据用户名查找 open_id，请先使用 search_user 工具","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"chat_id":{"description":"限定搜索范围的会话 ID（oc_xxx）","type":"string"},"mention_ids":{"description":"被@用户的 open_id 列表","type":"array","items":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6}},"message_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"消息类型过滤：file / image / media。为空则搜索所有类型"},"sender_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"发送者类型：user / bot / all。默认 user"},"chat_type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"会话类型：group（群聊）/ p2p（单聊）"},"relative_time":{"description":"相对时间范围：today / yesterday / day_before_yesterday / this_week / last_week / this_month / last_month / last_{N}_{unit}（unit: minutes/hours/days）。与 start_time/end_time 互斥","type":"string"},"start_time":{"description":"起始时间（ISO 8601 格式，如 2026-02-27T00:00:00+08:00）。与 relative_time 互斥","type":"string"},"end_time":{"description":"结束时间（ISO 8601 格式，如 2026-02-27T23:59:59+08:00）。与 relative_time 互斥","type":"string"},"page_size":{"description":"每页消息数（1-50），默认 50","minimum":1,"maximum":50,"type":"number"}}}},{"name":"feishu_oauth","description":"飞书用户撤销授