_xxx）或文件消息的 file_key（file_xxx）","type":"string"},"type":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"资源类型：image（图片消息中的图片）、file（文件/音频/视频消息中的文件）"}}}},{"name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","description":"【以用户身份】获取群聊或单聊的历史消息。\n\n用法：\n- 通过 chat_id 获取群聊/单聊消息\n- 通过 open_id 获取与指定用户的单聊消息（自动解析 chat_id）\n- 支持时间范围过滤：relative_time（如 today、last_3_days）或 start_time/end_time（ISO 8601 格式）\n- 支持分页：page_size + page_token\n\n【参数约束】\n- open_id 和 chat_id 必须二选一，不能同时提供\n- relative_time 和 start_time/end_time 不能同时使用\n- page_size 范围 1-50，默认 50\n\n返回消息列表，每条消息包含 message_id、msg_type、content（AI 可读文本）、sender、create_time 等字段。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"open_id":{"description":"用户 open_id（ou_xxx），获取与该用户的单聊消息。与 chat_id 互斥","type":"string"},"chat_id":{"description":"会话 ID（oc_xxx），支持单聊和群聊。与 open_id 互斥","type":"string"},"sort_rule":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"trajectory-depth-limit","limitDepth":6},"description":"排序方式，默认 create_time_desc（最新消息在前）"},"page_size":{"description":"每页消息数（1-50），默认 50","minimum":1,"maximum":50,"type":"number"},"relative_time":{"description":"相对时间范围：today / yesterday / day_before_yesterday / this_week / last_week / this_month / last_month / last_{N}_{unit}（unit: minutes/hours/days）。与 start_time/end_time 互斥","type":"string"},"start_time":{"description":"起始时间（ISO 8601 格式，如 2026-02-27T00:00:00+08:00）。与 relative_time 互斥","type":"string"},"end_time":{"description":"结束时间（ISO 8601 格式，如 2026-02-27T23:59:59+08:00）。与 relative_time 互斥","type":"string"}}}},{"name":"feishu_im_user_get_thread_messages","description":"【以用户身份】获取话题（thread）内的消息列表。\n\n用法：\n- 通过 thread_id（omt_xxx）获取话题内的所有消息\n- 支持分页：page_size + page_token\n\n【注意】话题消息不支持时间范围过滤（飞书 API 限制）\n\n返回消息列表，格式同 feishu_im_user_get_messages。","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["thread_id"],"properties":{"thread_id":{"description":"话题 ID（omt_xxx 格式）","type":"string"},"sort_rule":{"type":"string","enum":{"truncated":true,"reason":"traject